@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Experienced trainers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/experienced-trainers?minimumExperience=5

### Clients with overdue subscriptions
# DateOnly format: yyyy-MM-dd, without quotes or a time component.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/overdue-subscriptions?asOfDate=2026-09-15

### Most popular trainers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/popular-trainers?count=5

### Check hall availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/halls/5/availability?dateTime=2026-09-15T10:30:00

### Bookings in a hall for the month
# dateInMonth uses yyyy-MM-dd, without quotes or a time component.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/bookings?hallId=5&dateInMonth=2026-09-01
